      "author": "yanqingwang",
      "description": "Bidirectional sync, attachments, links, locks.\n\n## Phase 2 — Bidirectional Incremental Sync\n- VaultWatcher (file create/modify/delete/rename events)\n- ChangeQueue (debounced, persisted, crash-safe)\n- LocalPusher (local→remote with folder hierarchy)\n- DeltaPuller (remote→local via delta API)\n- ConflictResolver (duplicate/local-wins/remote-wins)\n- InitialSync (three-way merge)\n- SyncEngine state machine (Pushing→Pulling→Resolving)\n\n## Phase 3 — Attachments & Links\n- ResourceManager (upload/download resources)\n- LinkTransformer (wiki-link↔:joplinId conversion)\n\n## Phase 4 — Robustness\n- LockManager (sync lock acquire/refresh/release)\n- EncryptionService (E2EE skeleton)\n\n## Remaining\n- Full E2EE implementation (Phase 4)\n- getSettingDefinitions for Obsidian 1.13+\n- LinkTransformer integration into push/pull pipelines",
